{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e7293f6e-3ccd-43aa-9ad9-771674627e57","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed the state, cache-invalidation, defensive-copy, and monetary-rounding bugs across all four modules:\n\n- [store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157714624_baseline/store.py):\n  - Stored `unit_rate` and `discount_rate` as `Decimal` values.\n  - Incremented `version` and invoked registered invalidation hooks on `upsert_tenant` updates `(tenant_id, None)`, `update_tenant_tier` `(tenant_id, None)`, and `record_usage` `(tenant_id, period)`.\n  - Validated `units \u003e= 0` and `unit_rate \u003e= 0` using `Decimal`.\n  - Returned `copy.deepcopy(...)` from `upsert_tenant`, `update_tenant_tier`, `record_usage`, `get_tenant`, and `get_snapshot`.\n- [cache.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157714624_baseline/cache.py):\n  - Tracked `(resolved_version, invoice)` per `(tenant_id, period)` and enforced version matching in `get`.\n  - Used `copy.deepcopy` on both `set` and `get` to prevent caller mutations from affecting cached entries.\n  - Updated `invalidate` to remove all periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None` and return the count removed.\n- [billing.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157714624_baseline/billing.py):\n  - Replaced float arithmetic with `Decimal` and `ROUND_HALF_UP` quantization to `Decimal(\"0.01\")`.\n  - Returned a deep copy of `cached_invoice` when `(tenant_id, period, version)` matches `snapshot`, without re-applying discounts; otherwise recomputed from `snapshot`.\n- [api.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157714624_baseline/api.py):\n  - Wired `store.register_invalidation_hook` to `cache.invalidate`.\n  - Updated `preview_invoice` to perform version-checked cache lookups/writes and return defensive deep copies.\n  - Ensured `record_usage` and `change_tier_and_preview` invalidate stale cache entries.\n\nVerified with `python -m pytest` (`1 passed in 0.02s`).\n","duration_seconds":48.4873034,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":43747,"output_tokens":6778,"thinking_tokens":2394,"cache_read_tokens":142995,"total_tokens":50525}}}
